  - {fileID: 933946387}
  refundAllButton: {fileID: 1434104251}
  tooltipRoot: {fileID: 0}
  tooltipText: {fileID: 0}
  tooltipOffset: {x: 0, y: 18}
  tooltipMinSize: {x: 360, y: 96}
  tooltipMaxSize: {x: 560, y: 260}
  tooltipTextInsetMin: {x: 14, y: 12}
  tooltipTextInsetMax: {x: 14, y: 12}
  tooltipScreenEdgePadding: 16
  shopTextPopUp: {fileID: 1218888370}
  shopText: {fileID: 962068539}
  shopKeeperImage: {fileID: 722877365}
  popupSeconds: 7
  idlePromptSeconds: 14
  welcomeText:
  - If you got the gaba, I got the goods.
  - Come in, come in! You're so thin, are you eating enough? Have a canoli, on da
    house.
  - Mama mia, fresh face! Come, come, I got what you need!
  - Welcom to Gaba-Ghoul Goods! If you need a cheap pair of speakers, talk to my
    cousin Tony in the back.
  purchaseMadeText:
  - Pleasure doin' business.
  - Mama mia! You're practically stealing it at these prices!
  - Grazie! Come back soon my thrifty friend!
  - The only thing better than a sale is a plate of Ma's spaget.
  - Bada-bing bada-boom, I knew today was gonna be my day.
  - Anyone asks where you got this you let em know Gaba's got the goods, capiche?
  refundText:
  - Ma was right, I shoulda been a lawyer...
  - Dios mio, I'm ruined..
  - Ay caramba! You're breakin' my heart here!
  - My wifes gonna kill me. Rest in Pepperoni Gaba, you had a good life.
  - '"Don''t be a chef" they said... "Open up a shop" they said...'
  idleText:
  - You gonna buy somethin' or not, I got a sauce in the back callin' my name.
  - C'mon, I got a mortgage and 6 lil ghouls to raise.
  - "Take your time\u2026 no rush\u2026 but my pasta is gettin' cold."
  - How about two for one? No, no, no thats too much, fugedaboutit. Just hurry up.
  - I coulda been a doctor...
  welcomeImages:
  - {fileID: -5823329823067594605, guid: e9ba19d41dc3a8f419a36aadd787d8f8, type: 3}
  purchaseImages:
