    watchedPanelShouldBeVisible: 1
  - stepId: Monster_Select_4
    body: I will only be able to make so many copies and if we lose too many in battle
      we will be forced to retreat. Second, the copies will gain their own experience,
      but I will only be able to convert a small portion of that experience from
      the copy back to the original monster after a run is finished. (Press [F] to
